          "w": 0.88,
          "h": 0.4,
          "text": "\\begin{itemize}\n\\item $\\Delta U = Q - W$ — energy is conserved\n\\item $U$ depends on the state, $Q$ and $W$ on the path\n\\item Four ideal-gas processes, four sets of results\n\\end{itemize}",
